{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1724; --card:#0b1220; --accent:#ff7ab6; --muted:#98a1b3; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --success:#6ee7b7; --danger:#ff6b6b; --gold:#ffd166;
      --radius:14px; --f-sans: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg) 0%, #071021 60%);font-family:var(--f-sans);color:#e6eef6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}
    /* patterned hero using local SVG asset */
    .hero{min-height:36vh;padding:48px 24px;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;background-size:260px 260px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;width:100%;}
    header.site{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .badge{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#6b8cff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#082033}
    nav a{color:#cfe6ff;text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-weight:600}
    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.03),transparent);border-radius:20px;padding:26px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:24px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}

    form .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:var(--glass);color:#e8f0ff}
    button.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#6b8cff);border:none;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;color:#021826;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .moods{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
    .mood-btn{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:#dff1ff;cursor:pointer}
    .mood-btn.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#11263a66, #0b183066);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(2,6,23,0.45)}
    .method{margin-top:14px;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);}
    .method h3{margin:0 0 8px}
    .method p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .price-toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:6px}
    .switch{width:56px;height:30px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border-radius:999px;padding:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative}
    .knob{width:22px;height:22px;background:white;border-radius:999px;transform:translateX(0);transition:transform 280ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .switch.on .knob{transform:translateX(26px);background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#6b8cff)}
    .prices{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:baseline;margin-top:12px}
    .price{font-weight:800;font-size:22px}
    .price small{display:block;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}

    /* footer / policy */
    .policy{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}
    .notice{margin-top:10px;padding:12px;border-left:4px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01)}

    @media(max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding:28px 14px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="site">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="badge">TP</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="/index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="/about.html">Meet</a>
        <a href="/specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
        <a href="/approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="/fees.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="/faq.html">Help</a>
        <a href="/book.html">Schedule</a>
        <a href="/contact.html" style="font-weight:800">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="contact-hero">
      <div class="hero-card" id="contact-hero">
        <h1>Connect with a clinician who listens — on your terms</h1>
        <p class="lead">Start with a brief conversation to see which short course or ongoing pathway fits your current moment. No pressure, just a clear next step.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:14px;align-items:center">
          <a class="primary" id="primaryCta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <div class="muted">Or call: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:#eafff5;text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <main style="margin-top:18px">
      <div class="grid">
        <section>
          <div class="card">
            <h2 style="margin-top:0">Send a note</h2>
            <form id="contactForm" action="#" onsubmit="return false">
              <div class="row">
                <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Your name" required>
                <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="Email" required>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:10px">
                <input type="tel" id="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)">
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:10px">
                <select id="topic">
                  <option value="">Reason for reaching out</option>
                  <option value="single">Short focused work</option>
                  <option value="ongoing">Ongoing supportive sessions</option>
                  <option value="intensive">Weekend intensive</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:10px">
                <textarea id="message" rows="5" placeholder="A brief note about what brought you here"></textarea>
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
                <button class="primary" id="sendBtn">Send message</button>
                <div class="muted">Typical reply within 48 business hours</div>
              </div>
            </form>

            <div class="policy">
              <strong>Confidentiality & scope</strong>
              <div class="notice">Messages are treated with privacy. Email and text are not as secure as an in-session exchange; use discretion. This is not emergency care. If you are in crisis or at risk of harming yourself or others, contact local emergency services or a crisis line immediately.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0">Mood-to-Method selector</h3>
            <p class="muted">Pick how you feel and see which approach may help right now. This is an orientation, not a diagnosis.</p>
            <div class="moods" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Choose mood">
              <button class="mood-btn" data-key="overwhelmed" role="radio">Overwhelmed</button>
              <button class="mood-btn" data-key="stuck" role="radio">Stuck</button>
              <button class="mood-btn" data-key="direction" role="radio">Needing direction</button>
              <button class="mood-btn" data-key="recovery" role="radio">Recovering</button>
            </div>

            <div class="method" id="methodPanel" aria-live="polite">
              <h3 id="methodTitle">Gentle orientation</h3>
              <p id="methodSummary" class="muted">Choose a mood to reveal a recommended starting approach, with a short explanation and suggested next step.</p>
              <ul id="methodBullets" style="margin-top:10px;color:#dff8ff"></ul>
              <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
                <a class="primary" id="moodCta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
                <div class="muted">Or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:#dff8ff">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <aside>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0">Investment snapshot</h3>
            <p class="muted">Toggle between monthly support and short packages. Numbers animate to reveal the range.</p>
            <div class="price-toggle">
              <div class="price-toggle-desc muted">Show</div>
              <div class="switch" id="priceSwitch" aria-pressed="false" role="switch" tabindex="0">
                <div class="knob"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="price-toggle-desc muted">Package</div>
            </div>

            <div class="prices">
              <div>
                <div class="price" id="pricePrimary">—</div>
                <small class="muted">Lead pathway</small>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="price" id="priceAlt">—</div>
                <small class="muted">Short package</small>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px" class="muted">Packages and sessions are framed differently: choose monthly rhythm or concentrated work. Exact terms discussed during intake.</div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <a class="primary" id="pricingCta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Explore options</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
            <h4 style="margin:0">Care boundaries</h4>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">I work within the bounds of outpatient therapy. For urgent safety concerns, please use emergency services or crisis lines. Sessions are confidential within legal and ethical limits; we review records, limits, and consent during first contact.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:18px" class="card">
        <strong>Accessibility & notes</strong>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">If you require accommodations for communication or accessibility, please note that in your message or tell your clinician at intake. Fees, scheduling, and scope are discussed directly — there are no guarantees of specific outcomes.</p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer style="margin-top:22px;padding:18px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px">
        <div>&copy; <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> — Licensed clinician. Contact: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:#dff8ff">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        <div>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Confidential care within outpatient scope</div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Pricing comparator data
    const pricing = {
      monthly: {primary: 145, alt: 495},
      package: {primary: 420, alt: 1200}
    };
    const priceSwitch = document.getElementById('priceSwitch');
    const pricePrimary = document.getElementById('pricePrimary');
    const priceAlt = document.getElementById('priceAlt');
    const pricingCta = document.getElementById('pricingCta');

    let mode = 'monthly';
    function animateNumber(el, start, end, duration=600){
      const startTime = performance.now();
      function step(now){
        const t = Math.min((now - startTime) / duration, 1);
        const eased = (--t)*t*t+1; // easeOutCubic
        const current = Math.round(start + (end - start)*eased);
        el.textContent = '$' + current;
        if(now < startTime + duration) requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(step);
    }

    function flipTo(newMode){
      if(mode === newMode) return;
      mode = newMode;
      // animate knob class
      if(mode === 'package') priceSwitch.classList.add('on'); else priceSwitch.classList.remove('on');
      // animate numbers
      animateNumber(pricePrimary, parseInt(pricePrimary.textContent.replace(/\D/g,'')) || 0, pricing[mode].primary);
      animateNumber(priceAlt, parseInt(priceAlt.textContent.replace(/\D/g,'')) || 0, pricing[mode].alt);
      // update CTA label slightly
      pricingCta.textContent = mode === 'package' ? 'See packages' : 'See monthly plan';
    }

    // toggle behavior
    priceSwitch.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      flipTo(mode === 'monthly' ? 'package' : 'monthly');
    });
    priceSwitch.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{if(e.key==='Enter' || e.key===' '){e.preventDefault(); priceSwitch.click();}});

    // initialize values
    pricePrimary.textContent = '$' + pricing.monthly.primary;
    priceAlt.textContent = '$' + pricing.monthly.alt;

    // Mood-to-Method data and behavior
    const moodMap = {
      overwhelmed: {
        title: 'Calm-first orientation',
        summary: 'Short sessions that focus on immediate relief and grounding practices before exploring patterns.',
        bullets: ['Brief safety and stabilization', 'Simple skill-focused steps', 'One to three-session check-in offered'],
        cta: 'Request a stabilization call'
      },
      stuck: {
        title: 'Mapping session',
        summary: 'A guided session to map sticking points and sketch a pragmatic path forward.',
        bullets: ['Clarify current barriers','Identify practical next moves','Recommend session rhythm or a focused package'],
        cta: 'Book a mapping session'
      },
      direction: {
        title: 'Navigator pathway',
        summary: 'A brief plan to test choices and adjust course, with checkpoints for reflection.',
        bullets: ['Short planning sequence','Accountability check-ins','Option to transition to ongoing support'],
        cta: 'Start a navigator plan'
      },
      recovery: {
        title: 'Stability & growth',
        summary: 'Supportive sessions to consolidate gains and work toward sustained change.',
        bullets: ['Strength-focused sessions','Tools for relapse prevention','Flexible schedule options'],
        cta: 'Explore steady support'
      }
    };

    const moodBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.mood-btn');
    const methodTitle = document.getElementById('methodTitle');
    const methodSummary = document.getElementById('methodSummary');
    const methodBullets = document.getElementById('methodBullets');
    const moodCta = document.getElementById('moodCta');

    function setMood(key, btn){
      // visual
      moodBtns.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
      if(btn) btn.classList.add('active');
      // content morph (simple fade)
      const data = moodMap[key];
      methodTitle.style.opacity = 0; methodSummary.style.opacity = 0; methodBullets.style.opacity = 0; moodCta.style.opacity = 0;
      setTimeout(()=>{
        methodTitle.textContent = data.title;
        methodSummary.textContent = data.summary;
        methodBullets.innerHTML = '';
        data.bullets.forEach(it=>{const li=document.createElement('li');li.textContent=it;methodBullets.appendChild(li);});
        // CTA text updates and links with a query param to indicate mood
        moodCta.textContent = data.cta;
        // append mood tag to CTA URL for intake context
        moodCta.href = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' + '?mood=' + encodeURIComponent(key);
        // fade back in
        methodTitle.style.opacity = 1; methodSummary.style.opacity = 1; methodBullets.style.opacity = 1; moodCta.style.opacity = 1;
      },180);
    }

    moodBtns.forEach(b=>{
      b.addEventListener('click', ()=>setMood(b.dataset.key, b));
      b.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{if(e.key==='Enter' || e.key===' '){e.preventDefault(); b.click();}});
    });

    // friendly UX: default selection
    setTimeout(()=>{
      const first = document.querySelector('.mood-btn[data-key="overwhelmed"]');
      if(first) first.click();
    },200);

    // contact form faux send (no backend in this static demo)
    document.getElementById('sendBtn').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      if(!name || !email){
        alert('Please share your name and email so we can respond.');
        return;
      }
      // subtle confirmation
      document.getElementById('sendBtn').textContent = 'Message queued';
      document.getElementById('sendBtn').disabled = true;
      setTimeout(()=>{document.getElementById('sendBtn').textContent = 'Sent — thank you';},700);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact Page — private_practice_therapist

This bundle contains the contact page and a short README for the static frontend chunk for the private practice therapist site.

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html — self-contained page with inline CSS and JavaScript.

Key features implemented on contact.html:
- Hero and site navigation with an original label set (Home, Meet, Focus Areas, Method, Investment, Help, Schedule, Connect).
- Contact form (static; no backend) with simple client-side validation and friendly confirmation.
- Mood-to-Method selector: choose a current state (Overwhelmed, Stuck, Needing direction, Recovering). The panel morphs its content and the CTA text/href updates to include a mood query parameter. Animations are implemented via small JS fades and content replacement.
- Pricing Comparator (micro): toggle between "monthly" and "package" modes using a switch. Numbers animate using requestAnimationFrame and an easing function; CTA text in the pricing card also updates.
- Accessibility: buttons are keyboard-interactive and elements use aria attributes where appropriate.
- Policy and crisis language: confidentiality, scope boundaries, and a crisis notice are included to comply with therapist rules.

Placeholders used (must be replaced in deployment):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes on assets:
- The page references a local SVG pattern at `assets/img/pattern.svg` for background texture. Ensure that file exists in your site assets so the hero background displays as intended.

How to view locally:
1. Place this file (contact.html) in the site folder alongside the other pages.
2. Ensure `assets/img/pattern.svg` exists and any other site assets are available.
3. Open contact.html directly in a browser (no server required) or serve the folder with a simple static server (e.g., `npx serve` or `python -m http.server`).

Design notes / constraints:
- No external fonts, images, or CDNs are used in this file.
- The code avoids medical claims and uses supportive, clinician-appropriate language.
- This is a static demo for UI and UX; form submissions need a backend or form handling service to be fully functional.

If you need the companion SVG pattern or adaptations (e.g., different CTA behaviors or additional moods/pricing tiers), I can generate those in the next chunk."}
BUNDLE_END
